title: =(otherChanges KIND...)= -- what the node's files changed that no other leaf records
pid: 0b70a6f9-12c2-446e-a486-d956b7ddc0b6
body: |2-
  Each KIND is one way: =sectionMove= (its text moved between a private
  and a public section), =attributionChange=, =aliasSkgrepoMove= (an
  alias moved to another skgrepo), =contentOrder=, =forksOrder=,
  =hiddenOrder=, =aliasOrder=, =idOrder=, =flagOrder= (that list was
  reordered) and =otherInFile= (something else in its file changed). Its
  headline has no title. Its body, for each reordered list, is a header
  naming the list and the line diff of the order of the members both
  graphs give it, each line prefixed by a space, =-= (HEAD) or =+= (now);
  the parser keeps it and nothing reads it. One leaf, marked bare
  (=docs/diff-view.org=, "Other changes to a node's file").
